    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Puzzle: Face creative and diverse puzzle challenges along the way. Use your wits to overcome dangerous traps and obstacles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large Number of Themes and Maps: Explore many unique and attractive themes, each theme comes with many maps for you to challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels Get Harder Than Levels: Each level becomes more difficult, requiring your patience and skill to pass. Adjust the difficulty to your preference and challenge yourself each time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed Moving Camera: Experience a new feeling with a fixed moving camera in the screen, helping you focus more on your adventure without losing focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect Graphics and Music: Enjoy sharp graphics and catchy music throughout your journey, creating an amazing visual and auditory experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's embark on a never-ending journey together in Dino Run Puzzle and discover the wonders of the dinosaur world!</p>",
